{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3iESmYSs6H829DnyXi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*A heavy wooden door stands before you, ancient and weathered. Iron bands cross its surface, pitted with rust. A massive keyhole sits at its center, dark as a pupil.*\n\n*You hear the mechanism engage — tumblers falling, one by one, deep within the wood. A groan of iron. The sound of something that has been sealed for a very long time remembering how to open.*\n\n**CLUNK.**\n\n*A thin line of cold air escapes from the seam. The door shudders. It does not open — but it is no longer locked.*\n\n*The keyhole watches you, waiting.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":139,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}